WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.754
Bop, bop! Prr...

00:00:03.962 --> 00:00:04.796
Keep going.

00:00:06.965 --> 00:00:07.799
Wait.

00:00:08.133 --> 00:00:08.800
No.

00:00:13.263 --> 00:00:15.057
Billie passed her test.

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.475
She can drive now.

00:00:16.558 --> 00:00:17.267
Ooh!

00:00:17.351 --> 00:00:19.353
I can be alone, though.
That's what's important.

00:00:22.105 --> 00:00:24.024
This is my parents' bed,
and I sleep in here

00:00:24.107 --> 00:00:26.318
because I'm scared
of monsters in my room.

00:00:27.486 --> 00:00:29.238
-Billie.
-Ohh!

00:00:29.321 --> 00:00:30.489
I love you.

00:00:32.824 --> 00:00:34.409
Why can't we just miss people, though?

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:37.412
Why do we have to cope?
Why can't we just let it happen?

00:00:38.163 --> 00:00:39.373
Because it hurts.

00:00:40.749 --> 00:00:42.793
I can't believe my dream car
is in my driveway.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.838
We're getting a car with
all the safety bells and whistles.

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:46.839
Something y--

00:00:50.592 --> 00:00:51.802
Are you guys okay?

00:00:53.178 --> 00:00:55.180
Hey, you guys need to be okay.

00:00:55.639 --> 00:00:57.808
'Cause ya'll are the reason I'm okay. Okay?

00:01:02.938 --> 00:01:04.231
I love you.

00:01:09.820 --> 00:01:12.114
I just want us all to be
in the moment for this song,

00:01:12.197 --> 00:01:13.407
because I feel like...

00:01:13.991 --> 00:01:15.993
in life we tend to do things and then...

00:01:18.287 --> 00:01:20.247
we're always looking forward
to the next thing.

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:23.667
We're never thinking about
what's happening right now.

00:01:25.127 --> 00:01:26.753
And this is happening right now.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:30.424
We are never gonna be
in this moment ever again.

00:01:30.507 --> 00:01:31.758
So why don't we be in the moment yeah?

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.640
One more.

00:01:39.099 --> 00:01:40.851
There's two more shows.

00:01:41.602 --> 00:01:42.895
This is one.

00:01:44.479 --> 00:01:47.566
♪ I'm the bad guy ♪

00:01:50.861 --> 00:01:52.946
♪ I'm-I'm a bad guy ♪

00:01:53.155 --> 00:01:54.656
♪ Bad guy ♪

